The '''Redbrand family''' is a dwarven noble family that makes its home at the [[Redbrand Estate]] in the [[Mystic Ward]] of [[Ironforge]].

Although the Redbrands claim that they have served as the right hand to [[Madoran Bronzebeard]] during the [[War of the Three Hammers]],<ref>[[Torwyn Redbrand#Quotes]]</ref><ref>[[Torlig Redbrand#Quotes]]</ref> [[Redbrand Tablet|historical evidence]] reclaimed by adventurers from the Lower Reserve of [[Grim Batol]], now known as [[Dragonmaw Retreat]], indicates that their ancestry instead lies deep within the [[Wildhammer clan]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|38D|The Redbrand Lie}}</ref> The spirit of [[Halgan Redbrand]] still wanders its sacred halls, protecting them from intruders.

The Redbrands are a powerful family in Ironforge and hold sway across much of Khaz Modan;<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|36|Assault on Geth'kar}}</ref> most notably, its patriarch [[Nazgrim Redbrand]] commands the ear of the [[Miners' League|Miners' Guild]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|36|Ore Must Flow (2)|Ore Must Flow}}</ref> The Redbrands' influence reaches far, with them showing interest in some of the local traditions of [[Dun Kithas]] in the [[Grim Reaches]],<ref>[[Garlin Redbrand#Quotes]]</ref> as well as mining and archaeology at [[Redbrand's Digsite]] in the [[Badlands]].

